Subject: Goldfish: set aside cards that need opponents, read more wording

The solo test listed cards as "played without their effect" that only do
something to opponents or their creatures (votes, mass bounce, "bite"
spells, Auras that shut a creature down, regeneration), next to cards it
simply had no template for. A member read that list as the simulator
failing. Measured on Scryfall's oracle cards (2026-10-25): 16.0% of the
32,116 Commander-legal cards modeled, 10.9% set aside; Forge's 85
Commander precons 2023-2026: 51.6% of each deck's cards played with their
effect, 59.7% accounted for (played or set aside).

This patch, in mystic_forge/goldfish/rules_text.py:

- sets aside, as interaction with nothing to act on: a line that holds a
  vote (political), "return all ... to their owners' hands" (wipe), a
  creature dealing damage equal to its power to a target creature and the
  excess-damage rider (removal), regeneration (protection), and an Aura
  whose enchanted creature loses all abilities, can't attack or block,
  doesn't untap or gets a fixed base power and toughness (removal);
  permanents among them are still cast, as before;
- reads as free: "Enchant creature (you control)" (the Aura's other
  sentences decide), "can't be blocked by ...", "Choose a creature type /
  color", "Exile this spell"; and, with a note: a graveyard shuffled into
  the library, an activation discount (the full cost is paid);
- reads "put a land card from your hand onto the battlefield" as ramp_land
  (noted: the land comes from the library, tapped);
- notes, and never uses, miracle, overload, convoke, delve, improvise,
  undaunted, affinity and every landcycling/typecycling keyword, and reads
  "Equip <type> {N}";
- fixes a sentence with an interaction pattern and a rider (", then ..."
  or a second sentence) that was returned as unknown without being listed,
  so its card counted as fully modeled while that sentence never played (26
  Commander-legal cards, for example Displacer Kitten); an ability in quotes
  granted to the target is no longer taken for a rider.

tests/goldfish/test_known_answers.py: 16 new cases from real cards' text.

Measured with the same oracle file: 16.4% modeled, 11.9% set aside (the
rider fix moves 26 cards back to needing a model); precons 51.9% played
with their effect, 60.4% accounted for.

Upstream: Kautiontape/mystic-forge at dd82cd1 has no such reader. Needs
patches 0001-0011 applied first.

